Help topics  ? / esc to close                              
                                                           
  Topics (:help <topic>)                                   
  keys    the key bindings of the current view (same as ?) 
  config  every option, with its value, default and meaning
                                                           
  :help <command> describes any command.                   
  Use :help :<command> when its name is also a topic.      



